    "title": "Spartans baseball tryouts on Saturday for players 14-16 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "10 hours ago Ever wanted to be a Spartan? Now’s your chance. The 307 Spartans baseball team of Rock Springs is holding open tryouts for players ages 14 to 16. The first tryout session is set for 10 a.m. on Friday, November 28, at the Rock Springs Family Recreation Center. A second day of tryouts will be held on November 29, if needed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
